   "choice": "Every word's animation behaviour is now a recorded decision, implemented in renderAt via each word's anim field (vocabulary: pop / stamp / drift / sink / grow / small / still). Decided behaviours: 'identical.' (L1) STAMP \u2014 the thesis word lands like a press strike; 'wander:' (L2) DRIFT \u2014 the word sways sideways as copies drift; 'years.' (L2) SINK \u2014 the three-year cost settles downward; 'metal.' (L3) STAMP \u2014 the harder material lands harder than clay; 'repeats:' and 'press.' (L4) STAMP \u2014 the mechanism striking is the line's content; '180' (L5) STAMP against 'one' (L5) SMALL \u2014 the stamped multitude against one quiet scribe's book; 'outnumbers' (L6) GROW \u2014 the word holds 1.15x, outgrowing its line; ALL of L7 (the close) STILL \u2014 fade only, no motion, matching the slowed delivery (GAP-3) and the dipped bed (GAP-4): the message stands still while everything before it moved. Every other word keeps the house pop. Behaviours affect motion only \u2014 placement, size, colour and timing are untouched. PER-WORD CONTAINER: every one of the 117 words carries its own entry in this file's word_decisions block (treatment + reason) \u2014 the choreographed words above, the close's stilled words, and every remaining word as a DELIBERATE as-is with its reason (emphasis is a budget; the record names what each quiet word is quiet FOR). Coverage: 117 of 117.",
   "alternatives": "Uniform pop for every word (the v2 behaviour) \u2014 rejected by the doctrine: undecided behaviour is randomness, and a close that bounces like a hook undercuts the line that must land coldest.",
   "context": "Doctrine: words must TELL the story, not appear and disappear; which words shrink, grow, change shape or flip is actively decided per word/beat and recorded. The choreography was added mid-build (before the render) so v3 ships it \u2014 no restart of finished parts was needed, only the scene rebuild + line re-renders.",
   "why": "Motion is the last free channel in a word-animation piece: when it carries meaning, the story reads sound-off; when it is uniform, it is decoration.",
